## The development of supply and sales on the Bratislava new-build market

Supply grew and demand grew with it. {cqSales} flats were sold against {pqSales} in {pqLabel} and {yqSales} a year ago. Sales were not distorted by an exceptionally high figure in one of the large projects — the strongest of them accounted for {qTopSellerN} flats. Demand therefore rose by {pqSalesPctEn}% against the previous quarter.

